# Derived knowledge layers — kept local, not versioned. Both rebuild from the AST
# at zero cost: `codegraph init` and `graphify update .`.
.codegraph/
graphify-out/

# `lat.md/` IS versioned, and that reverses `e2b83ca`, which un-tracked it.
# The premise changed underneath that decision rather than the decision being
# wrong: it was taken when the only consumer was `lat check`, which degrades
# cleanly to exit 0 when the directory is absent -- so nothing failed.
#
# The v1 kit made the intent layer an input to the gate. REQ-OBS-008 asks that
# drift between a decision and the code fail like a lint, and
# `tests/test_backlinks.py` (T-128/T-129) resolves every link the code writes
# into it. Verified by cloning the tree with the directory ignored: that test
# fails, and the CI `lat check` job has nothing to scan. A hand-authored layer
# that does not travel also leaves whoever holds the folder owning the only
# copy -- which `e2b83ca` recorded as a cost it accepted, and which versioning
# removes.

